OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,APensions and benefits services still
OL,4,Adown after 'cyber incident'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has assured benefits
OL,7,Frecipients and pensioners that usual
OL,8,Fpayments will continue to be made after
OL,9,Fsome claimants reported delays. It is
OL,10,Funderstood the department believes
OL,11,Fdelays were not linked to the cyber
OL,12,Fincident.
OL,14,FThe UK's former chief technology
OL,15,Fofficer David Knott told BBC Newsnight
OL,16,Fhis "strong suspicion" was that the
OL,17,Fdepartment had been targeted by
OL,18,Fhackers.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
