OL,3,AHow gamers are using AI and leaked
OL,4,Afiles to clone Grand Theft Auto 6
OL,5,
OL,6,FHot off its record-breaking console
OL,7,Flaunch, the developer of Grand Theft
OL,8,FAuto 6 is facing a problem ` and it's
OL,9,Fone that is increasingly affecting the
OL,10,Fwider games industry.
OL,12,FRockstar is yet to announce an official
OL,13,FPC version of GTA 6, but with the
OL,14,Femergence of powerful AI tools, coders
OL,15,Fand gamers have taken matters into
OL,16,Ftheir own hands.
OL,18,FThe developer has typically released
OL,19,FGrand Theft Auto on PC long after its
OL,20,Finitial console launch ` 19 months
OL,21,Flater in the case of GTA 5.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
