OL,3,ACarly Rae Jepsen's viral hit proves
OL,4,Awhat fans knew all along
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt provides the soundtrack to a pivotal
OL,7,Fsequence where the game's protagonists
OL,8,Fget their first taste of the high life
OL,9,F- zooming around on jet skis and
OL,10,Fshooting champagne bottles from the
OL,11,Fback of a yacht.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
