OL,3,AActor and comedian PJ Gallagher dies
OL,4,Aaged 51
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs well as his work in stand-up comedy
OL,7,Fand acting, Gallagher presented
OL,8,Ftelevision documentaries and was a
OL,9,Fmember of the breakfast show team on
OL,10,FRadio Nova.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
